		<title>GPT-6.2 Astra solved a math theorem no other AI could crack, then invented its own proof strategy</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/gpt-6-2-astra-solved-a-math-theorem-no-other-ai-could-crack-then-invented-its-own-proof-strategy/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/gpt-6-2-astra-solved-a-math-theorem-no-other-ai-could-crack-then-invented-its-own-proof-strategy/#respond</comments>
		
