		<link>https://the-decoder.com/ai-is-getting-better-faster-than-experts-can-reliably-test-whether-new-systems-are-safe-metr-warns/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/ai-is-getting-better-faster-than-experts-can-reliably-test-whether-new-systems-are-safe-metr-warns/#respond</comments>
		
